1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:02,061
[16 years ago, "My Crazy
Family" shooting set]

2
00:00:02,085 --> 00:00:03,837
Shooting at a
countryside like this?

3
00:00:03,962 --> 00:00:05,547
A little boy
plays the main lead

4
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:06,673
Right?

5
00:00:06,798 --> 00:00:08,300
You get what
this line means, right?

6
00:00:08,425 --> 00:00:09,425
Yeah

7
00:00:12,054 --> 00:00:13,597
Hyesung, wait here
for a bit, okay?

8
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:40,123
I know you're there

9
00:00:40,249 --> 00:00:41,541
Don't hide
and just come out

10
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:51,009
Sorry
I was curious

11
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:52,344
About shooting?

12
00:00:52,469 --> 00:00:55,097
Not only about
shooting but also you

13
00:00:55,222 --> 00:00:56,348
Me?

14
00:00:56,473 --> 00:00:58,684
You're really cool

15
00:00:58,789 --> 00:01:00,745
You look so confident
in front of adults

16
00:01:00,829 --> 00:01:01,937
and also on TV

17
00:01:03,272 --> 00:01:07,109
I wanna be someone
on TV just like you

18
00:01:07,234 --> 00:01:09,152
You can do it too

19
00:01:09,278 --> 00:01:11,238
Even a kid like me
did that, right?

20
00:01:11,363 --> 00:01:13,039
And I thought
you're handsome

21
00:01:13,123 --> 00:01:15,033
when I first saw you

22
00:01:15,158 --> 00:01:16,034
You saw me earlier?

23
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:17,452
You come here
every day

24
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,413
How could I not know you?

25
00:01:19,538 --> 00:01:21,748
Hyesung, the shooting
starts soon

26
00:01:21,873 --> 00:01:24,042
Who are you?
How did you get in here?

27
00:01:24,167 --> 00:01:26,169
This is a shooting set
You shouldn't be here

28
00:01:26,295 --> 00:01:26,878
Got it?

29
00:01:27,004 --> 00:01:28,004
Okay

30
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:34,218
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung!

31
00:01:34,261 --> 00:01:35,637
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung!

32
00:01:35,762 --> 00:01:37,848
- Lee Hyesung!
- Hyesung!

33
00:01:37,973 --> 00:01:39,224
-This way
-Hyesung!

34
00:01:39,349 --> 00:01:40,517
Hey, check over there!

35
00:01:40,642 --> 00:01:41,642
Hyesung!
